{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id1520141607"}, "name":{"label":"TerraDoom"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-04-20T09:08:50-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"2023.4"}, "id":{"label":"9842291748"}, "title":{"label":"Tedious to manage"}, "content":{"label":"If you want the best sound quality around use this app.\n\nThe smart voices (skip silences) and voice boost features are second to none even against others that have the same.\n\nMy only gripe with this app is having to select all or many podcasts to marked as played it’s nonexistent you have to hard swipe left or tap repeatedly so for a podcast that has over 100 episodes this is a big pain.\n\nStaying with pocket casts and won’t pay for premium until a select all or select all above/below is available and an easy way to mark as played. Then you’ll have a new customer. Keep up the good work and the ATP podcast.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
