{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id18188924"}, "name":{"label":"Fishman Dan"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-04-16T14:59:21-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"2023.4"}, "id":{"label":"9829583932"}, "title":{"label":"Terrible UI"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve used this for a while, but I can’t manage the UI. Main issues for me are switching to a different podcast or searching for new content. \n\nI seem to be stuck in the current pocast and cannot work out a simple way to get back to my list of podcasts with one tap. \n\nPaid for this but I’ve reverted to the default Apple podcast app.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id238638139"}, "name":{"label":"KiteO"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-04-15T20:32:19-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2023.4"}, "id":{"label":"9826768021"}, "title":{"label":"The best podcast app"}, "content":{"label":"I listen to a lot of podcasts. I really didn’t like when Overcast withdrew support for my older phone/system (I hope it was absolutely necessary, a lot of us don’t have much money…) and had to go on a tour of other podcast apps. Yikes. Fortunately got given sis’s older phone so I could download Overcast again. So flexible and intuitive by comparison, am loving it! Only downside is sometimes I find myself subscribed to things I don’t want, I think ads must be quite easy to subscribe to in the pocket.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
