{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id181934346"}, "name":{"label":"Sundaysnooze"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-03-05T04:42:07-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"2023.3"}, "id":{"label":"9681698478"}, "title":{"label":"Sleep timer does not fade out"}, "content":{"label":"My first test of a podcast app is to check if sleep timer cuts audio abruptly or fades it down gently.  Overcast cuts it abruptly.  This wakes me up, developers, defeating the point of the feature.  Let me know when you fix this and I’ll assess it further and reassess my star rating.  \nNote to developers: when you fix this, fade it down very gently.  Over 10 seconds or more.  Apple do fade but too quickly.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
