{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id942998956"}, "name":{"label":"jakobi87"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-08-29T20:20:45-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"2022.7"}, "id":{"label":"9032287314"}, "title":{"label":"A huge improvement, but UX issues remain."}, "content":{"label":"The new interface and features are a huge improvement and finally got me to become a daily user.\n\nThere are outstanding UX issues around how episodes queue though. \n\nThe “Play Next” button lacks clarity. As a user, I assumed this button would add a podcast to the my Queue and play it after my current podcast, as is the case in any other music or podcast player. However this doesn’t seem to be the case and what it actually does is still not 100% clear to me.\n\nThe app would be vastly improved by having a “Play Next” feature that is in line with the commonly accepted use of said button across most other apps.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
